 an event in a 5,400-square-foot room. If there should be at least 8 square feet per person, what is the maximum number of people that could attend this event?</p>","description":"","explanation":"","type":"mcq","multiColumn":false,"options":[{"id":97723,"html":"<p>588</p>","correct":false},{"id":97724,"html":"<p>675</p>","correct":true},{"id":97725,"html":"<p>15,274</p>","correct":false},{"id":97726,"html":"<p>43,200</p>","correct":false}],"selected":"","wasCorrect":false},{"id":26385,"html":"<p>If t = 4u, which of the following is equivalent to 2t?</p>","description":"","explanation":"","type":"mcq","multiColumn":false,"options":[{"id":97727,"html":"<p>8u</p>","correct":true},{"id":97728,"html":"<p>2u</p>","correct":false},{"id":97729,"html":"<p>u</p>","correct":false},{"id":97730,"html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span style=\"display:none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;u</p>","correct":false}],"selected":"","wasCorrect":false},{"id":26386,"html":"<p>How many teaspoons are equivalent to 44 tablespoons? (3 teaspoons = 1 tablespoon)</p>","description":"","explanation":"","type":"mcq","multiColumn":false,"options":[{"id":97731,"html":"<p>47</p>","correct":false},{"id":97732,"html":"<p>88</p>","correct":false},{"id":97733,"html":"<p>132</p>","correct":true},{"id":97734,"html":"<p>176</p>","correct":false}],"selected":"","wasCorrect":false},{"id":26387,"html":"<p>The ratio of the length of line segment XY to the length of line segment ZV is 6 to 1. If the length of line segment XY is 102 inches, what is the length, in inches, of line segment ZV?</p>","description":"","explanation":"","type":"mcq","multiColumn":false,"options":[{"id":97735,"html":"<p>17</p>","correct":true},{"id":97736,"html":"<p>96</p>","correct":false},{"id":97737,"html":"<p>102</p>","correct":false},{"id":97738,"html":"<p>612</p>","correct":false}],"selected":"","wasCorrect":false},{"id":26388,"html":"<p>The International Space Station orbits Earth at an average speed of 4.76 miles per second. What is the space station’s average speed in miles per hour?</p>","description":"","explanation":"","type":"mcq","multiColumn":false,"options":[{"id":97739,"html":"<p>285.6</p>","correct":false},{"id":97740,"html":"<p>571.2</p>","correct":false},{"id":97741,"html":"<p>856.8</p>","correct":false},{"id":97742,"html":"<p>17,136.0</p>","correct":true}],"selected":"","wasCorrect":false},{"id":26389,"html":"<p>The population density of Iceland, in people per square kilometer of land area, increased from 2.5 in 1990 to 3.3 in 2014. During this time period, the land area of Iceland was 100,250 square kilometers. By how many people did Iceland’s population increa